{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 180,
    "dDurationMs": 2589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This tiny robot weighs\nless than a tennis ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2880,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can jump higher than\nanything in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9150,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the competitive\nworld of jumping robots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11310,
    "dDurationMs": 2771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the previous record was 3.7 meters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14190,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enough to leap a single-story building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16830,
    "dDurationMs": 2556,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This jumper can reach 31 meters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19470,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "higher than a 10-story building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23790,
    "dDurationMs": 1035,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could jump all the way from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24930,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Statue of Liberty's\nfeet up to eye level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30690,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For something to count as a jump,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32790,
    "dDurationMs": 2345,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it must satisfy two criteria."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35220,
    "dDurationMs": 2985,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, motion must be created\nby pushing off the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so, a quad-copter doesn't count"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40500,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it pushes off the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43200,
    "dDurationMs": 2646,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And second, no mass can be lost,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45930,
    "dDurationMs": 4754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so, rockets constantly ejecting\nburnt fuel are not jumping,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50760,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and neither is an arrow\nlaunched from a bow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53370,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bow would have to come with the arrow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55350,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for it to count as a jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57840,
    "dDurationMs": 1486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many animals jump,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59370,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from sand fleas to grass\nhoppers to kangaroos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62880,
    "dDurationMs": 2118,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they launch their bodies into the air"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65130,
    "dDurationMs": 3305,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a single stroke of their muscles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68550,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The amount of energy delivered\nin that single stroke"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71310,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "determines the jump height."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73290,
    "dDurationMs": 1018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you wanna jump higher,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74430,
    "dDurationMs": 3014,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to maximize the\nstrength of the muscle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77550,
    "dDurationMs": 2163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best jumper in the animal kingdom is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79830,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Galago or Bush baby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83700,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's because 30% of\ntheir entire muscle mass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86400,
    "dDurationMs": 1988,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is dedicated to jumping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88470,
    "dDurationMs": 2788,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allows the squirrel-sized primate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91350,
    "dDurationMs": 3111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to jump over two meters from a standstill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94560,
    "dDurationMs": 3071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has like very small arms and upper body"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97710,
    "dDurationMs": 2123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's just like, huge jumping legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99900,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't have better\nmuscles or anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101220,
    "dDurationMs": 2083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just has more of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106088,
    "dDurationMs": 3388,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There are some clever jumping toys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109556,
    "dDurationMs": 1722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111360,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I used to play with\nthese poppers as a kid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113760,
    "dDurationMs": 1689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when you deform a popper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115500,
    "dDurationMs": 3219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you store energy in its deformed shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118770,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Effectively it becomes a spring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120900,
    "dDurationMs": 2557,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then just like an animal in one stroke"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123570,
    "dDurationMs": 2055,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it applies a large force to the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125760,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "launching itself into the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129058,
    "dDurationMs": 3174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(whimsical music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132360,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All elastic jumpers\nfollow the same principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134910,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of storing energy in a spring\nand releasing that energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138300,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a single stroke to jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141330,
    "dDurationMs": 1546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But none of the jumping toys we had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142980,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could compare to this tiny robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145965,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bouncy music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147720,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Of all the things that\nI have ever tried to film,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150660,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is the most challenging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153600,
    "dDurationMs": 3023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's so small,\nit accelerates rapidly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156720,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and travels a huge distance on each jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160830,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each takeoff happened faster\nthan we could even register."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168210,
    "dDurationMs": 2594,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, jumping might sound\nlike a niche skill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170880,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but engineered jumpers would be perfect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173100,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for exploring other worlds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174720,
    "dDurationMs": 3425,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "particularly where the atmosphere\nis thin or non-existent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178200,
    "dDurationMs": 2514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the moon with one sixth\nthe gravity of earth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180840,
    "dDurationMs": 3411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this robot would be able\nto leap 125 meters high"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184380,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and half a kilometer forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187050,
    "dDurationMs": 3741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rovers may struggle with\nsteep cliffs and deep craters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190920,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but jumpers could hop in and out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193710,
    "dDurationMs": 2353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fetching samples to\nbring back to the Rover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196170,
    "dDurationMs": 2228,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you don't lose much\nenergy when jumping,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198510,
    "dDurationMs": 989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if you could store"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199620,
    "dDurationMs": 2582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the kinetic energy back\nin the spring on landing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202320,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the efficiency could be near perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206520,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The team has already started\nto build an entire fleet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209130,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of jumping robots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210420,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of them can right\nthemselves after landing so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213390,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they can take off again right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216630,
    "dDurationMs": 1621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Others are steerable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218340,
    "dDurationMs": 2214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have three adjustable\nlegs that allow the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220650,
    "dDurationMs": 2173,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jumper to launch in any direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222900,
    "dDurationMs": 823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Essentially, what we've done is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223800,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've added three additional legs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225840,
    "dDurationMs": 1687,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that don't store energy\nbut rather allow it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227610,
    "dDurationMs": 2954,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to form a tripod sort of that\nallows it to point a direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230640,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and launch in that direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234090,
    "dDurationMs": 3047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But how does this\njumping mechanism work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237210,
    "dDurationMs": 2062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the main structure\nconsists of four pieces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239340,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of carbon fiber bound\ntogether by elastic bands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242820,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together they create a\nspring that stores all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245910,
    "dDurationMs": 2538,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the energy needed for\nthe jump at the top of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248580,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the robot is a small motor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250590,
    "dDurationMs": 2897,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a string wrapped around the\naxle is connected to the bottom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253620,
    "dDurationMs": 901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254640,
    "dDurationMs": 3485,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when the motor is turned\non, it winds up the string"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258240,
    "dDurationMs": 3388,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compressing the robot\nand this stores energy in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261750,
    "dDurationMs": 2514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the carbon fiber and rubber bands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264390,
    "dDurationMs": 1609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After about a minute and a half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266130,
    "dDurationMs": 2972,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the structure reaches maximum compression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269220,
    "dDurationMs": 1651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you know like when to put it down?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270990,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Basically once the bottom there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272550,
    "dDurationMs": 1324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sits inward and it can stand up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273990,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now it would roll over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275010,
    "dDurationMs": 765,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275880,
    "dDurationMs": 863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Then you put it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276840,
    "dDurationMs": 2139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Got it.\n- So as soon as you can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279090,
    "dDurationMs": 2925,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And at this point, a\ntrigger releases the latch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282120,
    "dDurationMs": 2698,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's holding the string on the axle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284910,
    "dDurationMs": 2644,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all the string unspools all at once and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287640,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the energy stored in\nthe spring is released."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295770,
    "dDurationMs": 1894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The jumper goes from a standstill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297750,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to over a hundred kilometers an hour"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300180,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in only nine milliseconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312030,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That gives an acceleration\nof over 300 g's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317190,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be enough to kill\nbasically any living creature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322290,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Watch out, watch out, watch out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324630,
    "dDurationMs": 3231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But how does it jump so much\nhigher than everything else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327990,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nearly 10 times higher than\nthe previous record holder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331650,
    "dDurationMs": 3351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, this jumper has three\nspecial design features."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335130,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, the jumper is incredibly\nlight at just 30 grams."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339060,
    "dDurationMs": 2448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It achieves this weight\nby employing a tiny motor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341610,
    "dDurationMs": 899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and battery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342600,
    "dDurationMs": 3412,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus its entire structure made\nof lightweight carbon fiber"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346110,
    "dDurationMs": 2572,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and rubber doubles as the spring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348780,
    "dDurationMs": 3505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Per unit mass natural latex\nrubber can store more energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352380,
    "dDurationMs": 2408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than nearly any other elastic material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354870,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "7,000 joules per kilogram."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362520,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the design of the spring\nmakes it ideal for its purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366060,
    "dDurationMs": 2508,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Initially they tried using\nonly rubber bands connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368700,
    "dDurationMs": 2104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to hinged aluminum rods,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370950,
    "dDurationMs": 3224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but with this design when\ncompressing it, the force rises"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374310,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a peak and then decreases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376650,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just feels like it all of a\nsudden got a lot easier to pull."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380550,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another design with only carbon\nfiber slats requires a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384150,
    "dDurationMs": 1235,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of force to get started,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385500,
    "dDurationMs": 2187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it increases linearly after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387810,
    "dDurationMs": 2814,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is more and more\nforce required to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390750,
    "dDurationMs": 2843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ultimate design is a\nhybrid of these two approaches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393720,
    "dDurationMs": 2843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The benefit being it's\nforce profile is almost flat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396690,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the entire range of compression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399120,
    "dDurationMs": 1647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Feels like that needs a lot of force,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400890,
    "dDurationMs": 2546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now it feels pretty steady"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403560,
    "dDurationMs": 2112,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the amount of force\nthat I need to apply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405780,
    "dDurationMs": 2428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore it provides\ndouble the energy storage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408330,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a typical spring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409500,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where force is proportional\nto displacement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412110,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The researchers argue this is the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414270,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "efficient spring ever made."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418410,
    "dDurationMs": 942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Sometimes a string will snap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419460,
    "dDurationMs": 2228,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not always consistent\nthat it releases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421860,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it's supposed to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424080,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Ooh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425970,
    "dDurationMs": 690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's a string cut,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426803,
    "dDurationMs": 1191,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let me go re-string it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428151,
    "dDurationMs": 1078,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(fingers snap)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429390,
    "dDurationMs": 1507,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll be right back.\n- All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431040,
    "dDurationMs": 1826,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You'd probably expect\nthat lighter would always"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433020,
    "dDurationMs": 1114,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be better with a jumper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434280,
    "dDurationMs": 2323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially if the added\nweight is simply dead weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436740,
    "dDurationMs": 2465,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than anything useful\nlike a spring or a motor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439350,
    "dDurationMs": 2591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we're adding\nbasically a chunk of steel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442080,
    "dDurationMs": 2497,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to our jumper and it's gonna jump higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444720,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the key is that we're\nadding it to the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447420,
    "dDurationMs": 1328,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want your body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448890,
    "dDurationMs": 3228,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the part that's moving to weigh\nat least as much as the foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452250,
    "dDurationMs": 2137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when your body's lighter\nit's basically this collision"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454530,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this energy transfer is very inefficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456330,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you don't jump very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459090,
    "dDurationMs": 936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But the real secret to how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460140,
    "dDurationMs": 2355,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this jumper can achieve such\nheights is through something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462630,
    "dDurationMs": 3536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the researchers call work\nmultiplication, unlike an animal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466290,
    "dDurationMs": 2812,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which can only jump using a\nsingle stroke of its muscle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469200,
    "dDurationMs": 1737,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an engineered jumper can store up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471060,
    "dDurationMs": 2546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the energy from many\nstrokes or in this case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473700,
    "dDurationMs": 2142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many revolutions of its motor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475950,
    "dDurationMs": 2361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's how the motor can be so small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478410,
    "dDurationMs": 2604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't have to deliver\nthe energy all at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481170,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It builds it up gradually\nover a few minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483990,
    "dDurationMs": 3964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the trade off is kind\nof like time for energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488100,
    "dDurationMs": 722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488970,
    "dDurationMs": 1086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And this is possible because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490200,
    "dDurationMs": 2592,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a latch under\ntension preventing the spring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492960,
    "dDurationMs": 3536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from unspooling until the\nrobot is fully compressed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496650,
    "dDurationMs": 4217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Interestingly, biological\norganisms do use latches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501030,
    "dDurationMs": 1539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example the sand flee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502710,
    "dDurationMs": 3396,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which can jump incredibly\nhigh for its body size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506250,
    "dDurationMs": 2625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It has a muscle that is attached,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509010,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's say right here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510720,
    "dDurationMs": 2726,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is right inside of the pivot point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513570,
    "dDurationMs": 811,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as it contracts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514530,
    "dDurationMs": 1953,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that muscle the leg doesn't extend, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516630,
    "dDurationMs": 2422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually closing it more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519180,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then it has a second\nmuscle that pulls it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522840,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's going to shift this\nmuscle ever so slightly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527190,
    "dDurationMs": 1605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "outside the pivot point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528930,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's wild. So there's these\ntwo muscles that are working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531840,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah. So here's your big power muscle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533580,
    "dDurationMs": 1254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here's your trigger muscle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534960,
    "dDurationMs": 1609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a torque reversal mechanism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536670,
    "dDurationMs": 2302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then all of a sudden it shoots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539070,
    "dDurationMs": 2671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But even though the\nbiological world has latches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541920,
    "dDurationMs": 3225,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no organism has developed\nwork multiplication for a jump"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545310,
    "dDurationMs": 1136,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from standstill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546630,
    "dDurationMs": 4053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least not internally, spider\nmonkeys have been observed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550860,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pulling back a branch hand\nover hand using multiple muscle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554490,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strokes stored in the\nbend of the branch to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557610,
    "dDurationMs": 2349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "catapult themselves forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560100,
    "dDurationMs": 2462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a spider that\nshoots out a silky string"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562710,
    "dDurationMs": 1854,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which they pull back\nmultiple times in order"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564720,
    "dDurationMs": 3314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to slingshot themselves\nto another location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568170,
    "dDurationMs": 1399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's like slingshotting itself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569700,
    "dDurationMs": 1883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes. So they are called\nthe slingshot spider."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573990,
    "dDurationMs": 2486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now I tried jumping\nin moon boots to see if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576630,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would help me go higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580889,
    "dDurationMs": 1359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That is okay.\n(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582389,
    "dDurationMs": 1127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583664,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ooh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586080,
    "dDurationMs": 2408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And it certainly felt like they did,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588630,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Elliot pointed out\nthat from a standing start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591510,
    "dDurationMs": 1349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't actually help much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592980,
    "dDurationMs": 2315,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Like kinda build it, build\nit, build it, and then go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595421,
    "dDurationMs": 708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596254,
    "dDurationMs": 3111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only if you jump a few times\nbefore, can you store up some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599490,
    "dDurationMs": 3579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the previous jumps energy\nin the elastic bands and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603180,
    "dDurationMs": 3273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that energy helps launch you\nhigher on the following jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609240,
    "dDurationMs": 2338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years, engineered\njumping was developed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611670,
    "dDurationMs": 3144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mimic biological jumping,\nbut with work multiplication"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614910,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it gained an advantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616770,
    "dDurationMs": 2048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can generate a\nlarge burst of energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618930,
    "dDurationMs": 2424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply by running a motor for a long time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621450,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the power of the motor is no\nlonger the limiting factor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624480,
    "dDurationMs": 1112,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The spring is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625680,
    "dDurationMs": 1513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can focus on making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627270,
    "dDurationMs": 2426,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most powerful spring possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629790,
    "dDurationMs": 3042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This jumper has nearly\nmaximized the achievable height"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632910,
    "dDurationMs": 1123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with this spring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634110,
    "dDurationMs": 1658,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Assuming an infinitely light motor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635850,
    "dDurationMs": 3355,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with infinite time to wind\nup the highest possible jump"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639270,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with this compression spring is only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641010,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around 19% higher than\nwhat they've achieved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644460,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to incorporate air resistance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646620,
    "dDurationMs": 1327,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and play with aerodynamics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648030,
    "dDurationMs": 1986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another way to send\nthe jumper higher is to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650070,
    "dDurationMs": 2982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make it 10 times\nisometrically larger leading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653100,
    "dDurationMs": 2488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a 15 to 20% higher jump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655650,
    "dDurationMs": 2107,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we're in kind of an\nintermediate scale where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657810,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we still are getting hit by air drag"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659310,
    "dDurationMs": 1817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not as bad as the flee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661260,
    "dDurationMs": 1269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we went 10 times bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662640,
    "dDurationMs": 2491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could actually avoid drag completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665260,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This works since if the\njumper is scaled up ten times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668310,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on all sides the cross\nsectional area increases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671220,
    "dDurationMs": 851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a hundred,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672180,
    "dDurationMs": 1993,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which increases the drag force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674280,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the jumper's mass\nincreases by a thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677730,
    "dDurationMs": 2483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it has way more inertia meaning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680310,
    "dDurationMs": 2163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the drag force affects it less."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685110,
    "dDurationMs": 2243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entire concept of work multiplication"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687450,
    "dDurationMs": 2473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could bring robots to the next level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690000,
    "dDurationMs": 2926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Currently motors and robots\nhave to be relatively small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693030,
    "dDurationMs": 1631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they remain portable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694740,
    "dDurationMs": 1422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the simple principle of building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696240,
    "dDurationMs": 1924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up the energy from\nmultiple turns of a motor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698250,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over time would allow robots to store"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701070,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then release huge amounts of energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703980,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and set some world records in the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708075,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(outro music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714090,
    "dDurationMs": 2259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting this robot off\nthe ground required more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716400,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than just engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717660,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took a deep understanding\nof math and physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720210,
    "dDurationMs": 2612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you wanna take your\nSTEM skills to the next level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722940,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I highly recommend this\nvideo's sponsor Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725820,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a website, an app\nthat helps you learn Math"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728130,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Science and Computer\nscience interactively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730620,
    "dDurationMs": 1311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have thousands of lessons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732060,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with exclusive new content added monthly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734520,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they cover everything from the basics"
    } ]
  }, {
